### View current User counts (Denormalized)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Create a new task (Should trigger +1 in User count)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Check Trigger Task",
    "user_id": 1
}

### Verify count bumped
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### Delete a task (Should trigger -1 in User count)
# Assuming id 1 exists
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/1
